Package: karchi-headless
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Gooder24 <162874774+Gooder24@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: laptop-server, reboot-when-idle, unattended-upgrades, systemd-resolved, systemd-timesyncd, libpam-systemd, iwd, wireless-regdb, tailscale, tailscale-archive-keyring, fastfetch, console-setup, btrfs-progs, sudo, openssh-client, ca-certificates, curl, nano, less
Description: KarchiOS Headless on Debian: a laptop that serves AI agents
 Everything the system has beyond Debian's base, as one package. Its parts:
 laptop-server (the lid, sleep, a dark display, the battery limit, zram),
 reboot-when-idle (updates and reboots that wait for agents), and its own
 files: Wi-Fi through iwd, cable through systemd-networkd, Tailscale SSH,
 automatic security updates, a health check (karchi-doctor), fastfetch.
